x4 T1 [[Legendary Weapons|Legendaries]] ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=rare}}'''Serpent''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is currently obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2026]] by collecting 15,000 '''[[Candies (2026)|Candies]]''' {{Currency|Candies2026}} and purchasing the 26th tier, or through trading.

== Appearance ==
The knife features a long, green serpent with red eyes and a red tongue on the blade, hence the name. The entire serpent seems to be lying on a background that contains a darker shadow of itself, with its tail spiraling into the handle. The guard is colored a dark green.
